%% @version 1.0.0
%% @date 2026-07-24
%% @type flowchart
%% @level system
flowchart TD
    Start([ChEMBL API Integration Start]) --> Init[Initialize ChEMBL Adapter]
    
    Init --> Auth[Authentication Setup]
    Auth --> AuthKey{API Key Available?}
    AuthKey -->|Yes| ConfigKey[Configure API Key]
    AuthKey -->|No| NoKey[Use No-Auth Mode]
    ConfigKey --> Request[Request Construction]
    NoKey --> Request
    
    Request --> Endpoint[Select ChEMBL Endpoint]
    Endpoint --> EndType{Endpoint Type?}
    EndType -->|Activity| Activity[Activity Endpoint]
    EndType -->|Target| Target[Target Endpoint]
    EndType -->|Compound| Compound[Compound Endpoint]
    EndType -->|Assay| Assay[Assay Endpoint]
    
    Activity --> Params[Build Request Parameters]
    Target --> Params
    Compound --> Params
    Assay --> Params
    
    Params --> Pagination[Pagination Setup]
    Pagination --> PagType{Pagination Type?}
    PagType -->|Cursor| Cursor[Cursor Pagination]
    PagType -->|Offset| Offset[Offset Pagination]
    PagType -->|Scroll| Scroll[Scroll Pagination]
    
    Cursor --> RateLimit[Rate Limit Check]
    Offset --> RateLimit
    Scroll --> RateLimit
    
    RateLimit --> RateCheck{Rate Limit OK?}
    RateCheck -->|Yes| HTTP[Execute HTTP Request]
    RateCheck -->|No| Wait[Wait for Rate Limit Reset]
    Wait --> RateLimit
    
    HTTP --> Response[Receive Response]
    Response --> Status{Response Status?}
    Status -->|200 OK| Parse[Parse Response]
    Status -->|429 Rate Limit| Wait
    Status -->|5xx Server Error| Retry[Retry with Backoff]
    Status -->|4xx Client Error| Error[Handle Error]
    
    Retry --> RetryCount{Max Retries?}
    RetryCount -->|No| Error
    RetryCount -->|Yes| Backoff[Wait with Backoff]
    Backoff --> HTTP
    
    Parse --> Validate[Validate Response Format]
    Validate --> Valid{Valid JSON?}
    Valid -->|Yes| Extract[Extract Data]
    Valid -->|No| Error
    
    Extract --> Transform[Transform to Domain Model]
    Transform --> Domain[Create ChEMBL Domain Entity]
    Domain --> NextPage{More Pages?}
    NextPage -->|Yes| Pagination
    NextPage -->|No| Complete[API Integration Complete]
    
    Error --> Log[Log Error Details]
    Log --> Metrics[Emit Error Metrics]
    Metrics --> Fail[API Integration Failed]
    
    Complete --> Success[Emit Success Metrics]
    Success --> End([ChEMBL API Integration End])

    style Start fill:#e1f5ff
    style End fill:#e1f5ff
    style Complete fill:#c8e6c9
    style Fail fill:#ffcccc
    style AuthKey fill:#fff4e6
    style RateCheck fill:#fff4e6
    style Status fill:#fff4e6
    style Valid fill:#fff4e6
    style NextPage fill:#fff4e6
    style RetryCount fill:#fff4e6
